                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "In store, the loop variable 'err' shadows the named return and the ErrExists case uses 'continue'; behavior is correct, but the retry-exhaustion path is only proved with a Create that always fails, not with Names re-listing changing between attempts. The race test covers one retry. Coverage is adequate; this is a minor note only.",
                "proof_refs": [
